  <acqinfo id="1715eb21fe72e162d870e7ed68465f1c">
    <head>Immediate Source of Acquisition</head>
<p>The Commonwealth Fund records were donated to RAC in 1985. The initial transfer of archival records to RAC began in 1986, and transfers continue on a regular basis. These Commission files were transferred to RAC as Accession 2007:077.</p>  </acqinfo>
  <scopecontent id="12e77655d762f2483b6850358be28ee3">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>This series contains meeting books of the Commonwealth Fund Commission for a High Performance Health System, including but not limited to: agendas, background information, commission members, participants, attendees, and schedule of speakers and events.</p>  </scopecontent>
